{
  "slug": "cc-meme",
  "name": "Cc Meme",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "This is a task notification plugin that delivers notifications not through traditional text or sound, but via custom animations and images. It utilizes standard hooks to enable developers to seamlessly interact with claude code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 hooks**.\n\n- **Hooks** (9): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `PostToolUseFailure`, `Stop`, `StopFailure`, `Notification`, and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cc-meme@claude-community` from `wuyouMaster/cc-meme`.\n\n为 <a href=\"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code\">Claude Code</a> 添加趣味浮动动画覆盖层",
